   Matlin, Samantha L., Scattergood Fdn, Philadelphia, PA USA.
   Matlin, Samantha L.; Tebes, Jacob Kraemer, Yale Univ, New Haven, CT USA.
   Hausman, Alice J., Temple Univ, Philadelphia, PA 19122 USA.},
