   Tsai, Jiun-Horng; Hung, Tzu-Lin, Natl Cheng Kung Univ, Dept Environm Engn, Tainan 701, Taiwan.
   Tsai, Jiun-Horng, Natl Cheng Kung Univ, Res Ctr Climate Change \& Environm Qual, Tainan 701, Taiwan.
   How, Vivien, Universitiy Putra Malaysia, Dept Environm \& Occupat Hlth, Serdang 43400, Selangor, Malaysia.
   Chiang, Hung-Lung, Natl Yunlin Univ Sci \& Technol, Dept Safety Hlth \& Environm Engn, Yunlin 64002, Taiwan.},
